@startuml
title PN Infra Cognito, API Gateway, and VPC Endpoint - System Architecture

skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam wrapWidth 200
skinparam maxMessageSize 150

actor "Infrastructure Operator" as Operator
actor "API Client" as ApiClient

package "Installation & Orchestration" {
  component "CloudFormation Templates\n(YAML, 2010-09-09)" as CFTemplates
  folder "Installation Inputs\n- AWS profiles\n- Environment name\n- DNS/domain\n- API keys\n- Account IDs\n- Certificate IDs\n- Stage name\n- VPC/Subnets/VPC CIDR\n- NLB ARN\n- SQS regional service name\n- Token validity units" as InstallInputs
  Operator --> CFTemplates : Deploy stacks\nvia AWS CLI profiles
  InstallInputs --> CFTemplates
}

node "Cognito Account" as AccCog {
  component "Cognito Stack" as CognitoStack
  component "Cognito User Pool" as UserPool
  component "User Pool Client\n(read/write attributes: custom:Role, email)" as UserPoolClient
  component "Identity Pool\n(AllowUnauthenticated = true)" as IdentityPool
  component "IAM Role (Authenticated)" as AuthRole
  component "IAM Role (Unauthenticated)\nAssumeRoleWithWebIdentity\nPrincipal: cognito-identity.amazonaws.com\nConditions: amr=unauthenticated, aud=IdentityPoolId" as UnauthRole
  component "Identity Pool Role Attachment" as RoleAttach

  CognitoStack --> UserPool
  CognitoStack --> UserPoolClient
  CognitoStack --> IdentityPool
  CognitoStack --> AuthRole
  CognitoStack --> UnauthRole
  CognitoStack --> RoleAttach

  UserPoolClient --> UserPool : Provider link
  IdentityPool --> UserPoolClient : Cognito Provider\n(UserPoolId, ClientId, ProviderName)
  RoleAttach --> IdentityPool
  RoleAttach --> AuthRole : map authenticated
  RoleAttach --> UnauthRole : map unauthenticated

  note bottom of CognitoStack
  DR-001/FR-002/NFR-003:
   - Token validity unit parameters
     Access/ID/Refresh tokens:
     [days|hours|minutes|seconds]
  DR-003/FR-003:
   - User attributes include
     custom:Role and email
  end note

  note right of UnauthRole
  FR-006/NFR-004:
   Trust policy:
    - Action: sts:AssumeRoleWithWebIdentity
    - Principal: cognito-identity.amazonaws.com
    - Condition:
       amr = unauthenticated
       aud = IdentityPoolId
   Attached policy limited to unauth actions
  end note
}

node "API Gateway Account" as AccApi {
  component "API Gateway Stack" as ApiGwStack
  component "Amazon API Gateway\n(REST API)" as ApiGw
  component "Cognito Authorizer\n(type: COGNITO_USER_POOLS)" as Authorizer
  component "Method: GET /whoami\n(WhoAmI)" as WhoAmI
  component "Method: ANY /ecs\n(ECS Proxy)" as EcsMethod
  component "Integration: VPC Link\n-> NLB (input ARN)" as VpcLink
  component "Deployment & Stage\n(Output: CallbackURL)" as Deployment

  package "Networking (VPC)" {
    component "VPC\n(VpcId, VpcCidr)" as VPC
    component "Subnets\n(configured list)" as Subnets
    component "Security Group\nIngress: TCP 0-65535\nSource: VpcCidr" as Sg
    component "Interface VPC Endpoint\nService: com.amazonaws.<region>.sqs\nPrivate DNS: true" as SqsEndpoint
  }

  queue "Amazon SQS (Regional Service)" as SQS
  component "Network Load Balancer\n(provided input)" as NLB

  ApiGwStack --> ApiGw
  ApiGwStack --> Authorizer
  ApiGwStack --> WhoAmI
  ApiGwStack --> EcsMethod
  ApiGwStack --> VpcLink
  ApiGwStack --> Deployment

  WhoAmI --> Authorizer : Requires Cognito auth
  EcsMethod --> Authorizer : Requires Cognito auth
  Authorizer --> ApiGw : Attached as authorizer

  ApiGw -down-> Deployment : StageName
  Deployment ..> ApiClient : Output: CallbackURL\n(API endpoint)

  ApiClient --> ApiGw : Invoke methods

  EcsMethod --> VpcLink : Integration request\nforwards header:\n x-pagopa-pn-cx-role
  VpcLink --> NLB

  SqsEndpoint -[#blue]-> SQS : Private connectivity

  VPC --> Subnets
  SqsEndpoint --> VPC
  SqsEndpoint --> Subnets
  SqsEndpoint --> Sg
  Sg -down-> VPC : Ingress source = VpcCidr

  note right of WhoAmI
  FR-010/CI-001:
   - Method response declares header:
     x-pagopa-pn-cx-role (optional)
   - Integration response maps from
     Cognito claim: custom:Role
   - Status: 200
  end note

  note bottom of EcsMethod
  FR-011/CI-002:
   Integration request header:
    x-pagopa-pn-cx-role
   value <- Cognito authorizer claim custom:Role
   Integration via VPC Link to NLB
  end note

  note bottom of SqsEndpoint
  FR-013/FR-014/NFR-001/NFR-002/DR-006:
   - Type: Interface
   - Private DNS: enabled
   - VPC: VpcId
   - Subnets: configured list
   - Security group ingress:
     TCP 0-65535 from VpcCidr
   - Service name: regional SQS
  end note
}

' Cross-account orchestration and parameters
CFTemplates --> CognitoStack
CFTemplates --> ApiGwStack
CFTemplates ..> AccApi : Parameters:\n- StageName\n- NLB ARN\n- VpcId/Subnets/Sg/VpcCidr\n- SQS regional service name
CFTemplates ..> AccCog : Parameters:\n- AuthName\n- CognitoUserPoolName\n- Token validity units

UserPool ..> Authorizer : Provide User Pool ARN
note on link #gray
FR-009/CON-003:
 API Gateway stack accepts
 Cognito User Pool ARN from the
 Cognito account to configure
 Cognito user-pool authorizer
end note

Deployment ..> WhoAmI : depends on method
Deployment ..> EcsMethod : depends on method

legend right
CI-001/FR-010: WhoAmI declares optional role header and maps from claim custom:Role
CI-002/FR-011: ECS integration forwards role claim header to backend
FR-012: CallbackURL output published for API endpoint
FR-013/FR-014/NFR-001/002: SQS interface endpoint with private DNS and SG restricted to VpcCidr
NFR-003: Token validity units constrained to [days|hours|minutes|seconds]
endlegend

@enduml
